    "2124584971562283143": {
      "account_followers": 2664,
      "account_handle": "ATSUUFX",
      "account_name": "ATSUSHI",
      "bookmarks": 0,
      "content_en": "IC, one of the world's largest FX brokers after Exness, but this is ridiculous lol.\n\nThey only answer questions in English now, and it's at the level where a reply might come a few days later, so it's tough.\n\nThere probably aren't many Japanese users, so I understand not offering Japanese support, but I don't want them writing sloppy things. https://t.co/W1q6sWJECU",
      "content_original": "エクスネスに次ぐ世界最大級のFXブローカーのICですが、これはおかしいでしょ笑。\n\nもう英語でしか質問に答えてくれないし、回答が数日後に来るかどうかのレベルなので厳しいな。\n\n日本人利用者少ないでしょうから日本語対応しないのは仕方ないですけど、いい加減なことは書いてほしくない。 https://t.co/W1q6sWJECU",
      "created_at": "2026-11-22T19:25:04Z",
